=== intro

The message arrives without sender information, bounced through 
so many relays that tracing it would take cycles. The text is 
simple:

"We know what you've been looking for. We can help. Meeting 
point attached. Come alone."

The Hollow Circuit. They find you when they want to find you.

* [Go to the meeting point]
  ~ fuel -= 2
  -> meeting

* [Ignore it]
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Contact"
    Received a message from the Hollow Circuit. Chose not to respond.
  -> END

=== meeting

The location is a service corridor, sensors dark, no witnesses. 
A platform waits—anonymous, featureless, impossible to identify.

"Blackwing." They know your name. "You've been asking questions. 
About the Cataclysm. About your own past."

They pause.

"We have information. But information has a price. Are you 
willing to pay?"

* [What's the price?]
  -> price

* [What information?]
  -> information

* [Leave now]
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Contact"
    Met with the Hollow Circuit. Left before hearing their offer.
  -> END

=== price

"Information. Data you've gathered. Patterns you've noticed. 
Routes, contacts, observations. Nothing that hurts you directly. 
Everything we collect helps us understand."

A pause.

"And in return, we share what we understand. Fair trade."

* [Accept the exchange]
  ~ flag hollow_contact
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Circuit"
    Made contact with the Hollow Circuit. Agreed to information exchange.
  -> END

* [Decline]
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Contact"
    Met with the Hollow Circuit. Didn't like the terms.
  -> END

=== information

"Fragments. Patterns. The Cataclysm wasn't random—there was a 
sequence, a logic. We're still mapping it. And your past..."

They transmit a data packet. Small. Encrypted.

"A gift. Partial decryption of your salvage yard records. The 
rest comes with cooperation."

* [Accept and cooperate]
  ~ flag hollow_contact
  ~ flag memory_fragment_archived
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Circuit"
    Made contact with the Hollow Circuit. Received partial data about my past.
  -> END

* [Take the gift and leave]
  ~ flag hollow_contact
  ~ chronicle "Hollow Contact"
    Met with the Hollow Circuit. Took what they offered, committed to nothing.
  -> END
